
================ ANSWER ================
To use vLLM with LangChain, you need to install the following Python packages:

- `vllm` (the vLLM library)
- `langchain_milvus` (for integration with Milvus)
- `langchain_openai` (for integration with OpenAI)
- `langchain_community` (for LangChain)
- `beautifulsoup4` (for web content loading)
- `langchain-text-splitters` (for text splitting)
- `langchain-text-splitters` (already included in `langchain_community`)

These packages are required to enable the integration between vLLM and LangChain.
========================================

